cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Fire-recognition R6 revised-split source archive"
version: 0.1.1
date-released: 2026-10-22
type: software
license: AGPL-3.0-only
message: "Please cite the version-specific Zenodo record for this source archive."
authors:
  - given-names: Junxin
    family-names: Chen
    affiliation: Hangzhou Dianzi University Information Engineering College
abstract: >-
  Curated source archive for the revised-split internal fire-recognition study,
  including the initial three-arm comparison and later random-negative replay
  control. The archive omits the exact study selection and fold map, predictions,
  thresholds, weights, and private run records required to recompute reported
  results. It is not a byte-identical commit of either historical execution.
keywords:
  - fire recognition
  - hard-negative replay
  - reproducibility
